==Battleground==
*6 [[Croco]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s (100%) spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**25 [[Squire Rel]]s (100%) spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns.
**3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**4 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage overall, bring [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] if the One Horns give you trouble.

